#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:7
msgid ""
"Welcome to the **SecInterp** development guide. This document outlines "
"the standards, best practices, and workflows for contributing to the "
"project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:11
msgid "🏗️ Technical Stack"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:13
msgid "**Language**: Python 3.10+ (QGIS 3.x compatible)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:14
msgid "**GUI Framework**: PyQt5 (Native QGIS integration)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:15
msgid "**Geospatial Engine**: PyQGIS API (`qgis.core`, `qgis.gui`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:16
msgid "**Package Manager**: `uv` (recommended) or `pip`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:17
msgid "**Linter & Formatter**: `Ruff`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:18
msgid "**Testing**: `unittest` (Standard Library)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:22
msgid "🎨 Coding Standards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:24
msgid "🧬 Design Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:25
msgid "**SOLID**: Follow SRP, OCP, and DIP strictly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:26
msgid ""
"**Separation of Concerns**: GUI code (Managers/UI) MUST NOT contain "
"business logic. Delegating to `Core/Services` is mandatory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:27
msgid ""
"**DRY (Don't Repeat Yourself)**: If a calculation or check is used twice,"
" move it to a `core/utils` module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:29
msgid "📝 Naming Conventions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:30
msgid "**Classes**: `CapWords` (e.g., `ProfileService`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:31
msgid "**Variables/Functions**: `snake_case` (e.g., `calculate_apparent_dip`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:32
msgid ""
"**Qt Overrides**: `camelCase` (MUST match the original C++ signature, "
"e.g., `showEvent`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:33
msgid "**Signals**: `camelCase` (PyQt style, e.g., `dataChanged`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:35
msgid "🐍 Imports Ordering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:36
msgid "**Standard Library**: `os`, `sys`, `math`, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:37
msgid "**Third-Party**: `numpy`, `pandas`, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:38
msgid "**QGIS Core**: `from qgis.core import ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:39
msgid "**QGIS GUI**: `from qgis.gui import ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:40
msgid ""
"**PyQt**: `from qgis.PyQt.QtWidgets import ...` (Always use `qgis.PyQt` "
"shim)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:41
msgid "**Local Modules**: `from sec_interp.core import ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:45
msgid "⚡ Git Workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:47
msgid "Conventional Commits"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:48
msgid ""
"All commits MUST follow the [Conventional "
"Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) specification:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:50
msgid "**Format**: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:52
msgid "`feat`: A new feature (e.g., `feat(drill): add 3d projection`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:53
msgid "`fix`: A bug fix (e.g., `fix(gui): resolve range attribute error`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:54
msgid "`refactor`: Code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:55
msgid "`docs`: Documentation changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:56
msgid "`test`: Adding or correcting tests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:57
msgid "`chore`: Build process or auxiliary tool changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:59
msgid "**Language**: All commit messages must be in **English**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:63
msgid "🛠️ Tooling (Ruff)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:65
msgid ""
"We use **Ruff** for linting and formatting. It replaces Black, isort, and"
" Flake8."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:67
msgid "Basic Commands"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:79
msgid "IDE Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:80
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended to install the **Ruff extension** in VS Code and"
" enable \"Format on Save\"."
msgstr ""

