#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:123
msgid "Documentation Workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:125
msgid ""
"The project uses **Sphinx** to generate documentation. The build is "
"automated and publishes the result to a separate GitHub repository "
"(`sec_interp_docs`), which serves as the source for GitHub Pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:127
msgid "**Building and Publishing**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:134
msgid "The script performs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:136
msgid ""
"`sphinx-apidoc -o docs/source . docs/ tests/ scripts/ help/ build/ "
"--force --separate --module-first` — regenerates one autodoc page **per "
"Python module** of the plugin (`core/`, `gui/`, `exporters/`, `plugin/`, "
"`resources/` and the root entry points). It excludes `tests/`, "
"`scripts/`, `docs/`, `help/` and `build/`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:137
msgid ""
"`scripts/i18n/translate_docs.py compile` — compiles the `.po` message "
"catalogs to `.mo`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:138
msgid ""
"`sphinx-build` — builds HTML for **14 languages** (`en es fr pt_BR de ru "
"zh_CN id it pl nl fi hi ja`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:139
msgid "Copies the HTML to **`../sec_interp_docs/<lang>/`**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:140
msgid ""
"Syncs the offline manual into `help/html/<lang>` (image dedup; "
"search/API/sources stripped)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:141
msgid ""
"If `../sec_interp_docs/.git` exists, commits (`docs: auto-build from "
"sec_interp@<hash>`) and pushes to `geociencio/sec_interp_docs` (`main`)."
msgstr ""

