#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:151
msgid "[!warning] Side effects"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:152
msgid ""
"`make docs` regenerates the **tracked** `.rst` stubs in `docs/source/`, "
"leaving the working tree dirty — review and commit them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:153
msgid ""
"Step 6 performs a real `git push` to the external docs repo (there is no "
"flag to skip it). To build without publishing, run steps 1–5 manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:154
msgid ""
"`sphinx-apidoc --force` does **not** delete stubs for removed modules; "
"delete orphan `.rst` files in `docs/source/` if the build warns about "
"missing modules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md:156
msgid ""
"[!note] Shell note The language loop in the script assumes `bash`. When "
"replicating it in **zsh**, use an array (`LOCALES=(en es fr …)`) or `bash"
" -c`, since zsh does not word-split a scalar variable."
msgstr ""

